OL,5,G2100 Long Lost Family
OL,6,     FTwo people search for the sisters
OL,7,     Ftheir mothers never wanted to
OL,8,     Fplace for adoption. Before
OL,9,     FMichael's mother passed away, she
OL,10,     Fasked him to find the daughter she
OL,11,     Fplaced for adoption as a baby.
OL,12,     FMichael believes he matched with
OL,13,     Fher on a DNA website and is
OL,14,     Fdesperate to find her. Years
OL,15,     Fearlier, Melissa's mother told her
OL,16,     Fabout an older sister who had been
OL,17,     Fadopted as a baby. Now, with her
OL,18,     Fmother's early onset dementia
OL,19,     Fdiagnosis, Melissa is in a race
OL,20,     Fagainst time to find her sister
OL,21,     Fbefore it's too late. Davina
OL,22,     FMcCall and Nicky Campbell present
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
